dsh-obsidian-skills
===================

This package bundles agent skill documentation from a third-party project.

Upstream
--------
  Project : obsidian-skills
  Author  : Steph Ango (@kepano)
  Source  : https://github.com/kepano/obsidian-skills
  License : MIT

Bundled verbatim under skills/:

  skills/obsidian-markdown/SKILL.md
  skills/obsidian-markdown/references/PROPERTIES.md
  skills/obsidian-markdown/references/EMBEDS.md
  skills/obsidian-markdown/references/CALLOUTS.md
  skills/obsidian-bases/SKILL.md
  skills/obsidian-bases/references/FUNCTIONS_REFERENCE.md
  skills/json-canvas/SKILL.md
  skills/json-canvas/references/EXAMPLES.md
  skills/obsidian-cli/SKILL.md
  skills/defuddle/SKILL.md
  skills/knap/SKILL.md

These files are reproduced without modification. Wording and structure
belong to the upstream author. This package does not edit that text or
claim authorship of it; it only materialises the skills on disk and
registers them with the DeepSeek Harness skill registry.

Original work in this package
------------------------------
  lib/index.js          the Cordis loader that registers the skills
  scripts/sync-skills.mjs     upstream -> ./skills regeneration
  scripts/verify-package.mjs  pre-publish checks
  cordis.patch.yml      dsh bundle patch
  package.json          package metadata
  README.md, README.zh.md, skills.manifest.json

  (c) 2026 stevenjj33 — MIT

No binaries are bundled
-----------------------
Three of the skills describe how to drive command-line tools (obsidian,
defuddle, knap). Those tools are NOT included here and are not installed
by this package. Users install and run them separately.

